When `SGLANG_PROFILE_V2` is enabled, the `record_execution_trace` parameter is currently ignored because `ProfileManager.configure` does not support it. To prevent silent failures, we should return a failure `ProfileReqOutput` if execution trace recording is requested while V2 is active.

```suggestion
        if envs.SGLANG_PROFILE_V2.get():
            if record_execution_trace:
                return ProfileReqOutput(
                    success=False,
                    message="Execution trace recording is not supported in SGLANG_PROFILE_V2 yet.",
                )
            return self._profile_manager.configure(
